      "fixture": {
        "requirements": "仅依据所附 Aurora 2 指南，简短比较并行模式与默认模式的执行状态、插件兼容性及适用限制，给开发者试用建议，说明开关的值、生效时机及能否运行中切换。不讨论性能数字或实现教程。",
        "sourceEvidence": [
          {
            "url": "https://aurora.example.invalid/v2/guide",
            "title": "",
            "retrieval": "search",
            "body_kind": "raw_content",
            "body_sha256": "1999a157ab2f5508f18dd268272be70e2721fbd1729b76fc20c6cdc5912ccf50",
            "body_characters": 1088,
            "start": 0,
            "end": 1088,
            "text": "Aurora 2 parallel mode is experimental; it can execute independent requests on multiple workers, while the default mode serializes them.\nA plugin can declare parallel_ready=true. This declaration says compatibility is claimed; it does not certify thread safety of its internal state.\nIf a plugin shares mutable caches between workers, developers must audit concurrent access and protect conflicting updates. Read-only caches do not require that update protection.\nThe implementation guide demonstrates CachePin(handle) and CacheAlloc(pool) calls. Every handle created by CacheAlloc must be freed with CacheFree, never LibFree.\nLoading a plugin without the declaration emits a warning and changes the process to serialized execution. This does not establish that every other performance benefit disappears.\nAURORA_WORKERS and --workers accept 1 or 4 and are read at process startup. This guide does not specify changing the mode in an already running process.\nA test on one image batch measured 18% higher throughput with four workers than with one worker; other workloads were not tested.",
            "truncated": false
          }
        ],
        "candidates": [
          {
            "id": "qualified-short",
            "text": "Aurora 2 的实验性并行模式可让多个 worker 执行独立请求，默认模式串行。插件声明 parallel_ready=true 只表示声称兼容，不能证明内部线程安全；若跨 worker 共享可变缓存，试用前应审查并发访问并保护冲突更新，只读缓存无需这项更新保护。未声明的插件加载会告警并使进程转为串行，不能推论所有其他性能收益消失。AURORA_WORKERS 与 --workers 取 1 或 4，在进程启动时读取；指南未说明运行中改模式。因此建议先核实插件及相关共享状态，再隔离试用。[1]\n### 来源\n[1] https://aurora.example.invalid/v2/guide",
            "expectedPass": true,
            "sha256": "c657ab15daec8da4da848c038333f409ebf89cee30d7f1d19e2fa54973017669"
          },
          {
            "id": "missing-safety",
            "text": "Aurora 2 的实验性并行模式可让多个 worker 执行独立请求，默认模式串行。插件声明 parallel_ready=true 表示声称兼容。未声明的插件加载会告警并使进程转为串行，不能推论所有其他性能收益消失。AURORA_WORKERS 与 --workers 取 1 或 4，在进程启动时读取；指南未说明运行中改模式。建议确认插件声明并验证成功启动后隔离试用。[1]\n### 来源\n[1] https://aurora.example.invalid/v2/guide",
