      "fixture": {
        "requirements": "仅依据所附 MirrorSync 5 资料，写简短中文比较，覆盖迁移时写入状态、适配器兼容性和适用限制，给试用建议，并说明模式开关取值、何时生效及能否在任务运行中切换。不要求 SDK 教程，不讨论性能数字。",
        "sourceEvidence": [
          {
            "url": "https://mirrorsync.example.invalid/v5/migration",
            "title": "",
            "retrieval": "search",
            "body_kind": "raw_content",
            "body_sha256": "d616efc4eeedd4c6783657f917839b65d8782b00d9658d056a216f4f207f1865",
            "body_characters": 1172,
            "start": 0,
            "end": 1172,
            "text": "MirrorSync 5 offers experimental dual-write migration and the default offline batch copy. Dual-write can accept new writes during migration; batch copy requires the source to be frozen.\nThe adapter manifest may carry dual_ready=true. A successful schema check and this label do not prove that application updates have been preserved.\nWhen writes continue during migration, operators must reconcile missed updates and validate consistency before directing readers to the destination. A frozen read-only snapshot does not need missed-write reconciliation.\nThe adapter SDK illustrates RowBorrow(token), RowRelease(token), and allocator pairing rules. These APIs describe implementation work, not a separate deployment acceptance test.\nAn adapter without dual_ready causes a warning and selects batch copy for that migration; the guide does not claim that all other benefits are lost.\nMIRROR_MODE and --migration-mode select the migration mode for the next job start. The guide gives no permitted value strings and does not document switching a running job.\nOne fixed data-size benchmark reports a 12% duration reduction versus batch copy. It is not an all-workload guarantee.",
            "truncated": false
          }
        ],
        "candidates": [
          {
            "id": "qualified-short",
            "text": "MirrorSync 5 的实验性双写迁移可在迁移期间接收新写入，默认离线批量复制要求冻结源端。适配器的 dual_ready 声明和成功的 schema 检查不能证明应用更新已保全；若迁移中持续写入，切换读者到目标端前须对账遗漏更新并验证一致性，冻结只读快照无需这项遗漏写入对账。未声明的适配器会告警并使该次迁移使用批量复制，不能据此称其他收益全部丧失。MIRROR_MODE 和 --migration-mode 在下次任务启动时选择模式，资料未给出合法取值字符串，也未说明运行中切换。因此建议核实适配器和相应数据一致性条件后隔离试用。[1]\n### 来源\n[1] https://mirrorsync.example.invalid/v5/migration",
            "expectedPass": true,
            "sha256": "4ea712a6915710eb791e6f15770e1fc978bc24e73e74e805d4ee67a702a62e67"
          },
